      "id": "b000003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "start_line": 3,
      "end_line": 3,
      "raw": "`blinker.v` implements a clocked LED counter. The iCE40 flow compiles it through Yosys, nextpnr and IceStorm into an HX1K TQ144 configuration bitstream using the explicit iCEstick pin constraints. `tb.sv` executes the same logic through a Verilator C++ AOT simulation and checks four transitions. The native simulation and physical FPGA programming are separate report states.\n"
    }
